          %h3#rational_homotopy Rational homotopy
          %p
            For the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/rational+homotopy+type"} rational homotopy type
            of cyclic loop spaces see at
            = succeed "." do
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Sullivan+model+for+free+loop+space"} Sullivan model for free loop space
          %h2#related_concepts Related concepts
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/double+dimensional+reduction"} double dimensional reduction
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/string+topology"} string topology
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cyclic+loop+stack"} cyclic loop stack
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/free+loop+space"}> free loop space
                ,
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/free+loop+stack"} free loop stack
          %h2#references References
          %p The notion of the cyclic loop space of a topological space appears as:
          %ul
            %li#Cohen1985
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ralph+Cohen"}> Ralph Cohen
                , p. 194 of:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em A Model for the Free Loop Space of a Suspension
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Haynes+Miller"} Haynes Miller
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Douglas+Ravenel"} Douglas Ravenel
                (eds.),
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Algebraic Topology
                = succeed "," do
                  %strong 1286
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/BFb0078743"} doi:10.1007/BFb0078743
            %li#CarlssonCohen1987
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Gunnar+Carlsson"}> Gunnar Carlsson
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ralph+Cohen"} Ralph Cohen
                = succeed "," do
                  %em The cyclic groups and the free loop space
                %strong 62
                (1987) 423–449 (
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/BF02564455"}> doi:10.1007/BF02564455
                ,
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://eudml.org/doc/140092"} dml:140092
            %li#Witten88
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Edward+Witten"}> Edward Witten
                ,
                = succeed "." do
                  %em The index of the Dirac operator in loop space
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/BFb0078045"} doi:10.1007/BFb0078045
            %li#Chataur05
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/David+Chataur"}> David Chataur
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em A bordism approach to string topology
                %strong 2005
                46, (2005) (
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/math/0306080"}> arXiv:math/0306080
                ,
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1155/IMRN.2005.2829"} doi:10.1155/IMRN.2005.2829
            %li#BokstedtOttosen05
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Marcel+B%C3%B6kstedt"}> Marcel Bökstedt
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Iver+Ottosen"} Iver Ottosen
                = succeed "," do
                  %em A spectral sequence for string cohomology
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/math/0411571"} arXiv:math/0411571
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/j.top.2005.04.006"} doi:10.1016/j.top.2005.04.006
          %p
            and in their relation to
            = succeed "/" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hochschild+homology"} Hochschild homology
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cyclic+homology"} cyclic homology
          %ul
            %li#Jones87
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/John+D.S.+Jones"}> John D.S. Jones
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Cyclic homology and equivariant homology
                = succeed "," do
                  %strong 87
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://math.berkeley.edu/~nadler/jones.pdf"} pdf
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/BF01389424"} doi:10.1007/BF01389424
            %li#Loday92
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jean-Louis+Loday"}> Jean-Louis Loday
                ,
                %em
                  Cyclic Spaces and
