          %p
            and specifically for
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/complex+projective+spaces"} complex projective spaces
            in
            = succeed "." do
              %a{:href => "#Loday15"} Loday (2015), Sec 4
          %p
            Discussion in the context of the
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/transchromatic+character"} transchromatic character
          %ul
            %li#Stapleton13
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Nathaniel+Stapleton"}> Nathaniel Stapleton
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Transchromatic twisted character maps
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1304.5194"} arXiv:1304.5194
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/s40062-013-0040-9"} doi:10.1007/s40062-013-0040-9
          %p
            Specifically on cyclic loop spaces of
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/n-spheres"} n-spheres
          %ul
            %li#Hingston92
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Nancy+Hingston"}> Nancy Hingston
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  An Equivariant Model for the Free Loop Space of
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %msup
                          %mi S
                          %mi N
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} S^N
              %strong 114
              1 (1992) 139-155 (
              %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.2307/2374740"}> doi:10.2307/2374740
              ,
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://www.jstor.org/stable/2374740"} jstor:2374740
          %p See also:
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Urs+Frauenfelder"}> Urs Frauenfelder
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Dihedral homology and the moon
              %strong 14
              (2013) 55–69 (
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1204.4549"}> arXiv:1204.4549
              ,
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/s11784-013-0146-z"} doi:10.1007/s11784-013-0146-z
          %p
            A version of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cyclic+loop+stack"} cyclic loop stack
            of
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/orbifolds"} orbifolds
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Huan%27s+inertia+orbifold"} Huan's inertia orbifold
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/equivariant+elliptic+cohomology"} equivariant elliptic cohomology
            via
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Tate+K-theory"} Tate K-theory
            in:
          %ul
            %li#Huan18
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Zhen+Huan"}> Zhen Huan
              , Def. 2.14 of:
              = succeed "," do
                %em Quasi-Elliptic Cohomology I
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1805.06305"} arXiv:1805.06305
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/j.aim.2018.08.007"} doi:10.1016/j.aim.2018.08.007
          %p following
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Zhen+Huan"}> Zhen Huan
              , Section 2.1.2 of:
              = succeed "," do
                %em Quasi-elliptic cohomology
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "http://hdl.handle.net/2142/97268"} hdl
          %p and recalled/expanded on in several followup articles, such as in
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Zhen+Huan"}> Zhen Huan
              , Section 2 of
              %em Quasi-theories
              (
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1809.06651"}> arXiv:1809.06651
              )
          %p
            The above formulation of cyclic loop spaces, in the generality of
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%E2%88%9E-stacks"} ∞-stacks
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/base+change"} base change
            to the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/delooping"} delooping
